Common AdministrationPointOfContact
    documentation "Short list of information which identifies the point of contact for the administration of an assessment within an Education Organization."
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "A reference to the education organization."
        is part of identity
    shared string ElectronicMailAddress
        documentation "The email address for the contact."
        is part of identity
    shared string FirstName
        documentation "The conatcts's first name"
        is required
    shared string LastSurname
        documentation "The contact's last name"
        is required
    shared string IdentificationCode named LoginId
        documentation "The login ID for the user; used for security access control interface."
        is optional